<title>USA: Asarco, SPCC Q3 metal production and sales.</title>
<headline>Asarco, SPCC Q3 metal production and sales.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asarco Inc reported the following third quarter metal production and sales for itself and Southern Peru Copper Corp.</p>
<p>				  1996				   1995</p>
<p>	     Mined  Refined    Sales    Mined  Refined    Sales</p>
<p>Copper (000s lbs)</p>
<p>  Asarco 162,200  260,000  299,100  154,400  260,600  240,000</p>
<p>  SPCC   169,800  131,400  188,600  138,200  109,600  189,700</p>
<p>Consolidated</p>
<p>	   332,000  391,400  487,700  292,600  370,200  429,700</p>
<p>Asarco Beneficial Interest</p>
<p>	   251,300  329,000  398,100  226,400  317,800  339,000</p>
<p>Lead (000s lbs)</p>
<p>  Asarco  52,200   63,000   75,300   62,800  102,400  104,400</p>
<p>    SPCC	 -	  -	  -	  -	  -	  -</p>
<p>Silver (000s ounces)</p>
<p>    Asarco   749    6,057    5,601    1,476    8,128    9,583</p>
<p>  SPCC	 859	537	818	757	689    1,110</p>
<p>Consolidated</p>
<p>	     1,608    6,594    6,419    2,233    8,817   10,693</p>
<p>Asarco Beneficial Interest</p>
<p>	     1,200    6,339    6,030    1,871    8,487   10,162</p>
<p>Zinc (000s lbs)</p>
<p>    Asarco  43,800			 61,800</p>
<p>    SPCC	 -				  -</p>
<p>Molybdenum (000s lbs)</p>
<p>    Asarco 1,712		 1,741    1,476		 1,145</p>
<p>    SPCC   1,995		 2,152    1,921		 2,656</p>
<p>Consolidated</p>
<p>	     3,707		 3,893    3,397		 3,801</p>
<p>Asarco Beneficial Interest</p>
<p>	     2,759		 2,870    2,478		 2,530</p>
<p>Note: SPCC presented at 100 pct. Asarco consolidated SPCC effective Jan 1, 1995, based on Asarco's 52.3 pct equity ownership which, net of minority interests, constituted a beneficial interest of 43.2 pct.  Effective April 1995, Asarco's beneficial interest increased to 52.1 pct.  At Sept 30, 1996, Asarco's beneficial interest in SPCC is 52.5 pct. Its equity interest is 54.1 pct, while Phelps Dodge Corp owns 13.9 pct. --New York N-859-1610</p>
